# ABI v1.x — required exported symbols
# ===================================
# Additive-only policy:
#   - Required symbols must always be present.
#   - Missing or renamed symbol → CI FAIL.
#   - Additional symbols → PASS (additive is allowed).
# Covers v1.0 through v1.x.

mmap_engine_abi_version
mmap_engine_capabilities
mmap_engine_last_error
mmap_engine_open
mmap_engine_scan_chunks
mmap_engine_scan_chunks_ex
mmap_engine_scan_fixed
mmap_engine_get_chunk
mmap_engine_free
